        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Since the task is to find a canonical set of pole cancellation functions of Q at  $ \\beta $ and the corresponding root functions of  $ Q^{-1} $, we now determine these functions for k = m = 2. According to (2.1), we have",
