        {
            "block_label": "display_formula",
            "block_content": " $$ \\begin{array}{c}{Q_{-2}\\Psi_{2}\\neq0.}\\\\{ \\Rightarrow \\left(\\begin{array}{c c c}{1}&{0}&{0}\\\\ {0}&{0}&{0}\\\\ {0}&{0}&{0}\\end{array}\\right)\\left(\\begin{array}{c}{\\Psi_{1}^{2}}\\\\ {\\Psi_{2}^{2}}\\\\ {\\Psi_{3}^{2}}\\end{array}\\right)\\neq0.\\Rightarrow\\Psi_{1}^{2}\\neq0.}\\end{array} $$ ",
