        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "According to Corollary 2.1, every function of the form (2.13) with  $ \\psi_1^2 \\neq 0 $, and with the vector  $ \\psi_3 $ chosen arbitrarily, is a pole cancellation function of order  $ k = 2 $.",
