        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Since  $ \\psi(z) $ is a pole cancellation function of order  $ k = 2 $, the corresponding root function  $ \\hat{\\phi}(z) $ of  $ Q^{-1} $ is also of order  $ k = 2 $. According to (2.8),",
